{"id":12656,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/have-got/","parentId":540,"order":157,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Have got","seo":{"title":"Have got - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use 'have got' to talk about possession in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1Grammar-have-got.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T18:20:34","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct verb forms to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"598\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Transform these sentences using the verb <em>have got</em> like in the example below. Use <span>short forms</span> when possible: <em>‘ve got, ‘s got, haven’t got, hasn’t got</em>.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: They have a yacht ⇒ They <span class=\"textGap\">‘ve got</span> a yacht.</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"599\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Change the following sentences or questons into the past tense.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: They haven’t got a house ⇒ They <span class=\"textGap\">didn’t have</span> a house.</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"600\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<h2>Have got: Form</h2> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-12646\" src=\"/media/uploads/have-got_form.png\" alt=\"Colorful grammar chart displaying the form of 'Have got' in positive, negative, question, and short answer structures for different pronouns.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h4>Have got (British English) = have (American English)</h4> <p>The verb <strong>have got</strong> is a common form used in the UK, mainly when people are speaking. In the US, people use the verb <strong>have</strong>.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I<span><strong>‘ve got</strong></span> a car. = I have a car.</em></li> <li><em>I <strong><span>haven’t got</span></strong> a car. = I don’t have a car.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Have</strong></span> you <span><strong>got</strong></span> a car? = Do you have a car?</em></li> </ul> <h4>Be careful with this common mistake!</h4> <p>The verb <strong>have got</strong> only has a present form (NOT past).</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span>I <span><strong>had got</strong></span> a car. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></em></li> <li><em><span>I <span><strong>had</strong></span> a car. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></em></li> <li><em><span>I <span><strong>hadn’t</strong><strong> got</strong></span> a car. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"><br> </span></em></li> <li><em><span>I <span><strong>didn’t have</strong></span> a car. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></em></li> <li><em><span><span><strong>Had</strong></span> you <span><strong>got</strong></span> car? <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"><br> </span></em></li> <li><em><span><span><strong>Did</strong></span> you <span><strong>have</strong></span> car?&nbsp;</span></em></li> </ul> <h2>Have got: Use</h2> <h4>Possession, family</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>She<span><strong>‘s got</strong></span> a nice apartment.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Have</strong></span> you <span><strong>got</strong></span> a computer?</em></li> <li><em>I <span><strong>haven’t got</strong> </span>any brothers or sisters.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Illnesses</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I<span><strong>‘ve got</strong></span> a headache.</em></li> <li><em>She<span><strong>‘s got</strong></span> a cold.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Physical descriptions</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>He<span><strong>‘s got</strong></span> brown hair and a long nose.</em></li> <li><em>They<span><strong>‘ve got</strong></span> blue eyes.</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":598,"questions":[{"id":5119,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ a pen?</div>","choices":[{"id":8069,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Do you have got</span>"},{"id":8070,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Have you got</span>"},{"id":8071,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>You have got</span>"}]},{"id":5120,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>They _____ any children.</div>","choices":[{"id":8072,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>don't have got</span>"},{"id":8073,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>don't got</span>"},{"id":8074,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>haven't got</span>"}]},{"id":5121,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: 'Have you got a car?' B: 'Yes, I _____.'<br> </div>","choices":[{"id":8075,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>have</span>"},{"id":8076,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>do</span>"},{"id":8077,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>'ve got</span>"}]},{"id":5122,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>When we were kids, we _____ many toys.</div>","choices":[{"id":8078,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>hadn't got</span>"},{"id":8079,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>didn't have</span>"},{"id":8080,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>hadn't</span>"}]},{"id":5123,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He ____ a very nice family. </div>","choices":[{"id":8081,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>'s got</span>"},{"id":8082,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>have got</span>"},{"id":8083,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>'ve got</span>"}]},{"id":5125,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>There is a door here. _____ the key?</div>","choices":[{"id":8087,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Have you got</span>"},{"id":8088,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Do you got</span>"},{"id":8089,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Do you have got</span>"}]},{"id":5126,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>They _____ two cats and two dogs. </div>","choices":[{"id":8090,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>has got</span>"},{"id":8091,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>'ve</span>"},{"id":8092,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>'ve got</span>"}]},{"id":5124,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ a question?</div>","choices":[{"id":8084,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Have you</span>"},{"id":8085,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Do you have got</span>"},{"id":8086,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Do you have</span>"}]},{"id":5127,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _____ the answer to your question. </div>","choices":[{"id":8093,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>haven't</span>"},{"id":8094,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>don't have got</span>"},{"id":8095,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>haven't got</span>"}]},{"id":5128,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _____ a lot of money at the moment. </div>","choices":[{"id":8096,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>don't have got</span>"},{"id":8097,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>don't have</span>"},{"id":8098,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>haven't</span>"}]}]},{"id":599,"questions":[{"id":5129,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I have a new computer. ⇒ I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a new computer. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5130,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Do you have a new profile photo? ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a new profile photo?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5131,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She has blonde hair and blue eyes. ⇒ She <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> blonde hair and blue eyes.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5132,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't have a Twitter account. ⇒ I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a Twitter account.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5133,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She doesn't have any money. ⇒ She <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> any money.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5134,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: Do you have a laptop? B: Yes, I do. ⇒ A: Have you got a laptop? B: Yes, I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5135,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They have a lot of Youtube fans. ⇒ They <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a lot of Youtube fans. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5136,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He doesn't have any interest in science. ⇒ He <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> any interest in science. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5137,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Does she have a sister? ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a sister?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5138,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I have a terrible headache. ⇒ I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a terrible headache.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":600,"questions":[{"id":5139,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He's got a girlfriend. ⇒ He <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a girlfriend.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5140,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They haven't got any problems. ⇒ They <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> any problems. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5141,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Have you got a pen? ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a pen? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5142,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She hasn't got a sister. ⇒ She <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a sister. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5143,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He's got an exam. ⇒ He <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> an exam. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5144,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Has she got a cold? ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a cold?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5145,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Have you got a headache? ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a headache?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5146,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I haven't got time. ⇒ I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> time.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5147,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She's got a nice smile. ⇒ She <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a nice smile.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5148,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He hasn't got much experience. ⇒ He <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> much experience.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}